      "title": "Cinematic realistic oriental winter landscape photography of Jiangxue River Snow, vertical 9:16 portrait composition. Cold deep teal-grey tranquil freezing mountain river with realistic delicate ice water ripples and gentle drifting snowflakes. Towering distant snow-covered rugged mountain peaks and frosty pines enveloped in subtle pale winter mist. In the middle-lower center of the composition (centered horizontally in lower-middle section), an authentic solitary small rustic traditional wooden skiff boat is floating completely in view with both bow and stern fully visible, leaving generous breathing room on all sides. Aboard the center of the boat sits a solitary elder fisherman in textured traditional woven straw raincoat (suoyi) and bamboo conical hat (douli), quietly fishing with a slender bamboo rod. Subtle atmospheric gentle vignetting on left upper side with cold calm contrast. Pure authentic landscape photography, absolutely NO text, NO characters, NO user interface, NO frames, NO watermarks, NO cropped boat.",
